# AEGIS-Cloud — Simulation Data Directory
# ========================================
# This directory contains synthetic drone/hostile video files, sensor
# traces, and pre-cached AI response files used when the system is
# running in SIMULATION_MODE.
#
# Expected contents (to be populated):
#   • drone_flyby.mp4       — Synthetic drone flight video
#   • hostile_approach.mp4  — Simulated hostile UAS approach
#   • imu_trace.csv         — Pre-recorded ICM-20948 IMU trace
#   • tof_trace.csv         — Pre-recorded VL6180X ToF trace
#   • llava_cache.json      — Pre-cached LLaVA reasoning responses
#   • c2d_commands.json     — Simulated Cloud-to-Device commands
